  {
    "content": "Inflection demo",
    "revised": false
  },
  {
    "content": "{{@gender %qt #0}}",
    "revised": false
  },
  {
    "content": "Runtime inflection — CustomFlex engine with a backend",
    "revised": false
  },
  {
    "content": "The engine fetches the product's inflected form from the backend based on the quantity and re-renders when the response arrives; switch the language to see the lookup in the new locale.",
    "revised": false
  },
  {
    "content": "{{%qt *flexer #1}}",
    "revised": false
  },
  {
    "content": "Arbitrary contextual selection — CustomFlex engine with an embedded table",
    "revised": true
  },
  {
    "content": "No catalog and no network: the engine picks the variant by an arbitrary selector (the platform) from a JSON table. The surrounding sentence stays normal catalog i18n; only the shortcut comes from the engine.",
    "revised": true
  },
  {
    "content": "{{*help #2}}",
    "revised": true
  },
  {
    "content": "Message reuse — one definition, many uses",
    "revised": true
  },
  {
    "content": "A named message is defined in a single place and can be referenced anywhere else: the phrase and its inflection live in one entry, the translator edits it once, and each reference resolves its variables in the context where it appears. Change the product or the quantity above — both reused sentences follow.",
    "revised": true
  },
